## Required Output
Write failing test files in the worktree and {{.ArtifactDir}}/probe.json matching Schema Version 1:
```json
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "command": "test command (e.g. go test ./pkg -run TestBugRepro)",
  "files": ["relative/path/to/test_file.go"],
  "description": "What the test asserts and why it fails today."
}
```

Rules for probe.json:
- command and files must be non-empty.
- files must be relative paths inside the worktree without "..".
- The test command must fail (exit non-zero) when executed against the current repository state.

## Constraints
- The probe test MUST fail when executed.
- Do not modify non-test production files.
- Do not run git commit.
